theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 34
text = "Layla, the princess of the Moon Kingdom, 
stumbles upon a forgotten tower.

Hidden deep within an enchanted forest, 
where an ethereal maiden 
with hair spun from golden sunlight 
lives in solitude with her child. 

In this alternate universe, 
Rapunzel never escapes 
her secluded tower, 
raising her little one beneath 
its ancient walls, 
far from the world beyond."

